  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Relationships through Inter-cultural Dialogue and Growing Engagement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Building Relationships through Inter-cultural Dialogue and Growing Engagement (BRIDGE) Program builds partnerships and people-to-people connections between Indonesian and Australian teachers, students and school communities, and provides Indonesian and Australian educators with access to new knowledge and skills. The program establishes partnerships between participating Indonesian and Australian schools, provides professional development programs for educators, and organises reciprocal school visits for educators in their partner school community.</narrative>
  </description>
